{
	"Site": "Nexus",
	"Id": 29575,
	"Name": "Aimon's More Lively Sewer Retexture",
	"Author": "Aimon111",
	"Description": "[center][font=Comic Sans MS][size=3][i][color=#ffe599]This mod will change the look of vanilla sewer tiles to match my other mod -\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/19405]More Lively Sewer Overhaul[/url]\uFEFF.\n<br />\u00A0[/color][/i][/size]\n<br />[/font][/center][font=Comic Sans MS][b][u][color=#ffe599][center][size=3]What's the difference?[/size][/center][/color][/u][/b]\n<br />[center][size=3]This mod only changes the vanilla [u][color=#ffe599]SeweTiles.png[/color][/u] tilesheet - It does not add new content or change the sewer map itself.\n<br />Made this little retexture mod for more compatibility with other mods and expansions like Downtown Zuzu which adds its own custom sewer themed maps.[/size][/center]\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />[b][color=#93c47d][size=3][u]Installation:[/u][/size][/color][/b]\n<br />[list=1]\n<br />[*][font=Comic Sans MS][size=2]Install SMAPi, Content Patcher and all other required mods.[/size][/font]\n<br />[*][font=Comic Sans MS][size=2]Unzip \"Aimon's More Lively Sewer Retexture\" archive into Stardew&#92;Mods folder.[/size][/font]\n<br />[*][font=Comic Sans MS][size=2]Run the game using SMAPI.[/size][/font]\n<br />[*][font=Comic Sans MS][size=2]Enjoy![/size][/font]\n<br />[/list][b][size=3][u]I also recommend\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/28078]Change Sewer Color[/url]\uFEFF mod if you want to change the color overlay in sewer map.\n<br />[/u][/size][/b]\n<br />[color=#93c47d][size=3][b][u]Compatibility:[/u][/b][/size][/color]\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*][font=Comic Sans MS][size=2][color=#b6d7a8]Compatible[/color]\u00A0with expansions like SVE, Ridgeside, East Scarp, DownTown Zuzu...[/size][/font]\n<br />[*][font=Comic Sans MS][size=2][color=#b6d7a8]Compatible[/color]\u00A0with other retextures and recolors like VPR, Starblue Valley, Foliage Redone...[/size][/font]\n<br />[*][font=Comic Sans MS][size=2][color=#b6d7a8]Compatible [/color]with mods that change Sewer map look.[/size][/font]\n<br />[*][font=Comic Sans MS][size=2][color=#b6d7a8]And yes[/color], you can freely install both\u00A0More Lively Sewer Retexture and\u00A0More Lively Sewer Overhaul mods at the same time - there won't be any issues, its fully compatible.[/size][/font]\n<br />[/list]\n<br />[/font][center][b][font=Comic Sans MS][size=3]----------------------------------------------[/size][/font][/b][/center]",
